WEBVTT

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.830
Kumasa!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.870
I'm back! My bone's back together!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:28.290
Great job. I'm surprised it
took you this long, though.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.200
I can't believe it's been a month since that tragedy.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.620
Oink!

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.000
It's great that you made it in time.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.750
The popularity ranking, of course.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.500
The deadline is this weekend.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.500
Y-Yeah...

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.620
I haven't been able to buy merch
because of my leg,

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:47.950
which made Maina fall back
into last place again.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:52.040
At this rate, I'm not going to be able
to see Maina smiling as the center!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.330
I can't just sit here being a casual <i>wota</i>!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:28.700
"Run for Maina's Sake"

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.370
"Run for Maina's Sake"
Listen to this! I told Yuka that the show was starting,

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:35.200
but she kept messing with
her phone and wouldn't come out.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.580
She told us there was an event
going on with her game.

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:40.500
Don't tell them that!
My votes are gonna go down!

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.660
And they should go down!

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.200
Come on, you two.

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:47.250
Well, voting ends this week

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.250
and I'm pretty much guaranteed
to be in the front row.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.700
Don't say things like that, Yuka.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.370
Huh? What do you mean?

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:59.450
Yuka is really bad at reading the room...

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:02.290
I hope you guys continue
supporting us till the end!

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.450
Yeah!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.290
Fifteen Makis!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.660
Twenty Yukas!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.080
Here. Maina's handshake ticket.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.250
I have to go to work,

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.830
so interact with her in my place.

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:20.620
"Handshake ticket"
Wait, just one?

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:24.120
You're fully back, so I thought
you were going to go all out.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.040
Wait. Did you get too used
to being a casual <i>wota</i>--

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.830
No! I'm going to go all out on the last day!

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:31.250
Everyone loves a comeback story!

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.120
This is true.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.620
But don't push yourself too hard.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:39.250
I'm sure fatigue had something to do
with why you got hurt last time.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:43.290
Don't worry! It feels so great
to work for Maina!

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:44.620
You're not listening, are you?

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.080
Sorry it's me.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.500
I'm here in Eripiyo's place.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.000
No, er, I...

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.620
Did Eripiyo's house catch on fire or something?

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.700
I'm pretty sure that's not the case.

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:01.870
Eripiyo's working as hard as she can for you.

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:04.540
F-For me?!

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:07.120
Please tell her not to push herself so hard!

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.950
Okay. I'm sure she'll listen to you, Maina.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.830
"Birthplace of the <i>Kibi Dango</i>"

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:20.450
"Kumasa"
"Maina asked me to tell you to not work so hard"

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.370
OMG is she a literal angel?!

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:26.700
I'm so pumped now! Now I can work even harder!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.000
"[No experience needed] LANSOW Okayama Station Location"
"[2 days a week OK!] Kitchen Staff Wanted"
"[Rare Find] Kigurumi Event Staff"
"[Easy for beginners] Car guidance"

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.000
"Bread factory"
"Kigurumi Balloon Bunny"
"Convenience Store LANSOW"
"Priestess at Shrine"

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:42.040
I'm seeing a lot less of Sorane's
blue King's Blades out there.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:45.750
But that just means I have fewer rivals!

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:50.000
I don't care what place Sorane is in
as long as she's standing on that stage.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.250
If she ends up in the back row,

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:54.040
it'd probably be harder for her
to gain more popularity.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:57.080
I'd prefer if she belonged only to me anyway.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:04.370
There are more blues than greens.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.870
"4th Sorane"
"5th Yumeri"
"6th Aya"

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.410
Why, though?

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.830
What's wrong, Aya-<i>chin</i>? You mad?

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.080
No!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.580
Hey, Aya!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.870
This doesn't make sense at all!

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:27.910
Why do you think this is happening?

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:33.750
Why is Sorane's ranking higher than me
when there's a rumor about her and some guy?

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.410
I've never had rumors like that about me!

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:38.660
Well, you're the little sister type.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:41.910
Are you saying it'd be hard for me
to be number 1 because of that?!

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:43.580
Er, no...

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:49.250
But at the same time, it's rather rare
for a loli to be the center...

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.040
But we're still cheering for you.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.290
You're the only loli in the group, A-ya.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.910
And the loli role is super important.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:00.200
Lolis aren't needed?

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:02.290
"Last day for voting"

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:05.830
Yikes! Tomorrow's the last day for voting.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:09.620
A lot happened, but it went by so fast.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:10.620
Morning.

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.830
Wait... Who are you?!

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:15.910
"Drawn on"

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:19.450
It's Aya-<i>chin</i>! Wait, what?
Are you going through your rebellious phase now?!

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.200
I'm no longer a loli.

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.200
I'm not so sure about that...

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:25.700
Reo and I were always too similar,

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:28.950
so I tried to be more like Maki,
who's in second.

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:31.080
Exactly how do you see me...?

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.750
♪ I may seem childish but I'm not a child ♪

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:37.370
♪ I can do it if I actually try ♪

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:41.160
♪ I absolutely love <i>oba </i>leaves ♪

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.500
Who is that?

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.330
Well, she's small, so it must be A-ya.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:51.450
Was she that shocked she was
in 6th during the midterm results?

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:54.410
A-ya doesn't understand her character...

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.700
I wish she'd embrace her loliness.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:02.200
Hey, Aya-<i>chin</i>! Looks like your
image change failed big time!

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.200
Sowwy to keep you guys waiting!

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:08.950
She failed so badly, she quit immediately.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:16.580
You were gone, so there're this
many breads that weren't flipped.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:17.910
Leave it to me!

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.950
Look at her handle that bread!

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:26.080
She almost looks like a thousand-armed Kannon.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.700
My hard work will turn into Maina's CDs,

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:37.700
and the CD sales will allow Maina to
eat bread, which will become her sustenance.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.290
This is the best!

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:45.040
Indirectly, I'm living with Maina!

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.250
Man, I worked a lot...

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.250
But today's the last day...

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.410
Now, Maina will be first...

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:18.500
Eripiyo,

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:22.040
thank you for working so hard for me.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.620
Maina...

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.200
Okay, let's do this!

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.250
ChamJam...

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.450
Yeah!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.120
One, two, three, go!

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:54.250
Eripiyo's not here? Why?

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:01.410
Today's the last day for the popularity ranking.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:02.750
Ten Makis!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.040
Twenty Yukas!

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.450
Two Ayas!

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:07.080
A hundred Reos!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.450
Don't worry, Reo.

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.080
I promised you, remember?

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:16.120
I'll make you number one, no matter what.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:17.790
Thank you.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:19.700
I believe in you, Kumasa.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:27.330
I'm glad you came to see me again today, Motoi.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:30.200
I have fewer people lining up for me now, so...

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.580
Yeah!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:35.000
Everyone has no idea that the rumors are a lie.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.540
I think I might be able to have
Sorane all to myself soon!

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:41.120
Let the agency know.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:43.870
Eripiyo really didn't come...

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.370
Maina.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:48.080
Oh, Rena!

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.410
Hello. Are you here by yourself today?

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:51.830
I'm here with my brother.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.040
Oh, I see.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:56.370
You were really cute again today, Maina.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:58.290
Really? Thank you.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:09.700
If Eripiyo doesn't come to see me,
I can't see her...

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:18.450
She's awake.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.290
You okay there, miss?

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:21.540
Where am I?!

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:24.450
You came drifting down the channel.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:27.290
Just came tumbling down and down.

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:31.660
You kept muttering,
"Today's the last day... The last day."

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:32.830
The last day...

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:36.450
It's not broken.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:38.450
An ambulance is on its way.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:39.910
I'm fine if nothing's broken.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.870
Sorry for all the trouble!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.040
"Popularity ranking voting ends today!"
"Deadline 11/30"

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.000
Um...

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:07.000
Can I still buy some CDs?

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:10.370
A <i>yokai</i>! Or wait, it's just Eripiyo.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:12.950
--Let me buy merch... let me buy merch...

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:15.790
--But the deadline's passed...
--Let me buy merch... let me buy merch...

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:19.330
Even if you buy any now, they won't count...

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:26.830
It's fine. I just want to use this money
I made for Maina for her sake.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.620
Man, Reo was amazing again today.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:31.080
Did you see her beaming smile?

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:35.700
I think my heart connected
with Sorane's more than usual.

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:38.750
I mean... Eripiyo?!

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:42.620
E-Eripiyo, you're late.

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:46.830
I figured you'd be late, so I thought about
buying some of Maina's CDs for you,

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.830
but I figured you'd say there's no point unless
you bought them with your own money...

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:54.160
Liar! Every other <i>wota </i>is an enemy
during the popularity ranking!

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:59.450
I worked so hard just for today...

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:00.750
"Kumasa"
"Maina asked me to tell you to not work so hard"

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:05.000
I at least wanted to tell her
I wasn't working too hard...

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:08.830
That I was having fun working for her.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:18.160
Yay! Two SSRs!

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:19.450
Are you here, Maina?

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:23.000
Eripiyo was just here.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.080
"Aya-<i>chin</i>, your image change totally failed! Lol!"
"Shut up!!! No one asked you!!!"
She was here?

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:26.620
"Aya-<i>chin</i>, your image change totally failed! Lol!"
"Shut up!!! No one asked you!!!"
Yup, downstairs.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:32.450
I told her the deadline already passed,
so they wouldn't count as votes,

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:35.250
but she still bought all your CDs anyway.

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:44.500
But Eripiyo wasn't at our show today.

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:49.200
She was soaking wet,
so something probably happened.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.830
You've got a great fan, Maina.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:02.450
I wonder if she already got on the train...
She probably did.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:03.500
"Wait time"

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:09.330
I'm an idol, so I can't see Eripiyo
unless she comes to see me.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:21.080
Eri--

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:30.540
I'm so happy... I'm so happy...

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.040
I'm so happy!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.120
The next time she comes to shake my hand,

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:40.410
I need to tell her I'm so happy
before anything else!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:49.870
The day's finally here.

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.540
Yeah...

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:53.750
"Popularity Ranking Results Announcement Event!!!"

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:57.040
Which do you think is better, Eripiyo?

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.620
I think either one looks fine.

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:02.450
Could you take this more seriously?

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.790
I think it's fine that you get her a gift
to congratulate her for the ranking,

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.410
but why clothes?

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:10.620
"Fumi"
Fumi, the Yuka stan, gave me the idea.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:14.370
Apparently, if you give them clothes,
they'll wear them.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:18.290
Wow, that's hot, I guess. Super hot.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.450
You don't think that at all, do you?

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.790
Your face and words don't match.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:26.910
I want to get her clothes, but I don't have
the courage to ask one of the employees.

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:31.370
Yeah, and it's not like they talk to me, either.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:35.790
Yeah, you definitely don't look like
you're here to buy clothes.

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:39.500
Why don't you buy Maina some clothes, too?

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:41.080
I'm pretty sure Maina would say...

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.450
There's no way I'm wearing this.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:46.290
Yeah. Similar to what happened
with the <i>kibi dango</i>.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:48.160
You poor thing.

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.410
Are you looking for anything in particular?

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.700
Um, a girl's...

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:54.540
Is it a present?

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:55.750
Yeah...

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:57.950
Oh, it must be for your girlfriend.

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:00.120
So how old is your girlfriend?

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.660
Do you know her size?

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:04.330
Oh, she's 18 and 158 centimeters tall.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.200
She's on the slim side, has short hair,
and is in the tennis club.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:08.330
She looks great with black hair,
and her cat-like eyes--

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:10.200
I'm guessing she's either
a small or a medium then.

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.160
What kind of clothes does she usually wear?

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:16.580
Usually something stylish yet casual.

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.160
--Well, we got this in yesterday...
--They sure look like they're having fun.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.450
Pardon me...

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:25.700
I need to find some clothes as a gift, as well.

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:27.040
Oh, sure.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.700
She's wearing a tracksuit.

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:31.370
--So, who is this for?
--For who?!

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.790
What exactly is Maina to me?

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:37.330
That's actually a very difficult
question to answer...

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:38.620
She's 152 centimeters tall!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.500
She's blood type A, slim,
her limbs are super long,

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.620
her hair is about this long,
and her face is super cute!

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:46.660
She's basically my angel!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:48.200
An angel...

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:51.410
Maybe it's a younger sister
in some difficult relationship.

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.870
But her wings haven't grown in yet,

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:56.620
so it's better to not have holes
in the back of her clothes.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:57.660
I see.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.750
How about this?

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:03.500
Goodness...

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.750
My shift lasted longer than I expected.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:08.250
Hey.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.910
Oh? Were you two shopping?

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:13.620
Did you both get Reo a birthday gift?

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.750
Her birthday was more than a month ago.

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:19.450
No, no. Basically every day is her birthday.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.200
I guess we do thank them
for being alive every day! I get it!

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:24.620
Whatever. Let's just go in already.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:28.250
Yeah! Maybe thanks to the
30,000 stay-at-home Maina fans,

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.450
she might've gotten first place.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:37.580
Yeah, I don't know if I can do this.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:42.870
If I give her a present, I'm definitely
going to expect something in return!

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:44.000
Truth!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.450
It's not like I want Maina
to do something for me... right?

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:51.450
Yet, getting ignored after you give her
a present would be rather harsh, too.

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:54.290
But I definitely want something in return!

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:57.540
Please give this present to Sorane!

00:16:57.540 --> 00:16:59.750
Hey, it got ignored again.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.580
"Yuka Teramoto"
"Cannot be accepted because it's a gift certificate"

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:05.830
I guess a gift certificate to a café
isn't allowed either.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.870
I guess gift certificates aren't allowed.

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:10.040
Were you planning on getting her one?

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:13.620
Well, it's not like I know
exactly what she wants.

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:16.500
If only she'd mention it
in her MC or her blog...

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:21.040
There's no way I'd ever
wear something like this!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.580
Maybe I'll just wear it.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.200
"ChamJam Popularity Ranking"
"Results"

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:36.870
"ChamJam Popularity Ranking"
"Results"

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:42.410
"1st Reo Igarashi" "2nd Maki Hakata" "3rd Yuka Teramoto"
"4th Yumeri Mizumori" "5th Sorane Matsuyama"
"6th Aya Yokota" "7th Maina Ichii"

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.950
Reo's in the center!

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:58.580
How's that any different than usual?

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:00.080
It is different!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:03.290
This center is a special center!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:06.580
It signifies the connection
Reo has with her fans!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:11.540
I'm Reo, and I took first place.

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:15.000
I had a lot of mixed feelings
about the popularity ranking...

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:20.120
But I'm standing here right now
because of everyone who voted for me.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:28.620
I'm glad I believed in everyone.

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.830
Thank you all so much!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.500
Reo!

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:36.370
I'm Maki, and I took second place.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:40.080
Thank you to everyone who voted for me.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:42.120
I'll continue doing my best in the front row.

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.000
Thank you.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.450
Maki!

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:47.830
Guys, I got third place!

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:49.950
I'm so happy to be in the front row!

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:52.950
I mean, I was pretty sure I'd be up here, but...

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:55.040
Thank you!

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:57.950
Yeah... Yeah...

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.830
I'm Yumeri, and I placed fourth.

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:02.830
Thank you very much for voting for me.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:05.830
I had trouble being confident,

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.790
but I want to live up to everyone's support,

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.620
so I'll work even harder.

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:19.120
I'm Sorane, and I placed fifth.

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:22.500
Thanks to everyone who voted for me.

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:26.120
I'm a bit nervous having you
stand behind me, Sorane.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.830
Don't worry. I'll make sure to watch you guys.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:30.120
Oh, jeez.

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:39.910
To think that Sorane would
make a face like that...

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:45.370
It's because I didn't try harder...

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.910
"6th"

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.120
--Who the heck is that?!
--A-ya! She looks like a zombie!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.660
You're an idol, remember?!

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:57.500
Ready, and... A-ya!

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:02.160
Hey! It's me, A-ya! Everyone's little sister!

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.870
I hope you guys keep supporting me, te-he!

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.290
I'm Maina, and I placed seventh.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:11.790
Um... I hope you'll continue to support me.

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:14.620
I'm so upset!

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:16.540
She ended up in seventh after all!

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:19.790
Did all the other Maina at-home
fans die on the battlefield?!

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:22.450
Did you really believe that they existed?

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.700
Maina seems to be taking this lightly.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:26.830
She barely has an expression.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.870
So, yeah, that's how she always is.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.830
Oh? What's wrong?

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:45.250
I always want to tell Maina the happiest
and saddest things about me,

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:49.000
--but I wonder if Maina has anyone
she can talk to at times like this.
--Since I got third place, give me three SSRs!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.830
--but I wonder if Maina has anyone
she can talk to at times like this.
--Oh, Yuka.

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:53.580
In the end, an <i>otaku </i>is
nothing more than an <i>otaku</i>.

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:56.580
Though nothing means more
to me than Reo's happiness.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:58.250
Well, I feel the same way, too.

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:08.330
I wonder how I should tell
Eripiyo about the other day.

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:10.750
Congrats.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:17.250
U-Um... I'm really happy...

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.700
It looks like Maina's trying to say something.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:21.250
I guess I can't blame her.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:24.330
I told Maina I'd make her the center, and yet...

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:29.580
I couldn't do anything to make you first place.

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:32.700
Huh? But you did a lot...

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:37.660
Oh, only the staff person knows that
she bought the CDs after the performance.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:39.830
Maybe I shouldn't mention it.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:43.120
Why couldn't I revive faster?

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:46.250
But Eripiyo worked so hard for me.

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:50.040
I'm sorry I couldn't make first place.

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:51.160
Huh?

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:55.160
I'm sorry. I'm sorry I couldn't make you happy.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:01.080
You've always been number one
in my heart from the start!

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:05.040
You know that, right, Maina?!

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:12.250
Yes...

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:18.410
Oh, my gosh, you're such an angel.
You're the best.

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:20.120
Angel?

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:23.250
You're so cute. So cute...

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:27.500
I'm so embarrassed... but so happy.

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:29.000
I love you!

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:07.620
A-ya definitely doesn't
understand her character.

00:24:07.620 --> 00:24:09.870
I wish A-ya would embrace her loliness.

00:24:09.870 --> 00:24:13.450
By the way, we get to see A-ya in a
Santa outfit for the Christmas event, right?

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:16.330
Something's going to happen
on that holy night, A-ya!

00:24:16.330 --> 00:24:18.580
Right, A-ya? Right? Right?

00:24:18.580 --> 00:24:19.950
"I Want You in My Future"
And thank you very much!
